>>- SC2034 14:1 -- dump reads its argument by name through local -n and declare -p, and is called with the names in the names array
>>- SC2034 21:1 -- the nameref alias_of refers to third, so reading alias_of reads third
>>- SC2034 23:1 -- ${!pre_@} lists every variable whose name starts with pre_

